{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/30897ef604e10c54afc7d75fc594aaec.webp?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Play with your cat!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat generates gold every 30 seconds. Pet it or feed it to earn extra gold.\ud83e\ude99\u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/2f6cdf72ad1ebbcf88efcefda26f4e83.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/2f6cdf72ad1ebbcf88efcefda26f4e83.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Drag and drop files or documents to the cat, and it will shred them and throw them into the trash.\ud83d\uddce\u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/4c5d142eb504edeeb19d0616555011ca.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/4c5d142eb504edeeb19d0616555011ca.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Right-click the cat to open various Windows tools and quickly access your desired folders.\u2699\u2764\ufe0f<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/a2e3a6447e9559233babdaf6feedd99a.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/a2e3a6447e9559233babdaf6feedd99a.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Got tasks to do? Write them down in the To-Do List and enjoy the satisfaction of checking them off.\ud83d\udcdd\u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish a task in the selected program, the cat will cheer you on with a cute special celebration. \ud83c\udf89\u2764\ufe0f<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d628839083eb6eb1aa342cdac0e62ef8.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d628839083eb6eb1aa342cdac0e62ef8.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to buy a sofa! The cat will sit and enjoy music, movies, and more with you.\ud83c\udfa7\u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/710aea9fe745ab639d66a04d96d1bdb0.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/710aea9fe745ab639d66a04d96d1bdb0.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Adopt a cat and make it happy!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time together, collect coins, adopt new furry friends, and buy items that make them happy.\ud83d\ude3d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/cfbf5317fa6e27d57492dd4239f56fc2.webp?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Decorate your desktop to your taste. Adjust the cat\u2019s size and choose its personality to create your perfect companion.\ud83d\udc31\u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/918576c070d859299279bb43a6f6ea7c.poster.avif?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/918576c070d859299279bb43a6f6ea7c.webm?t=1757992831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/548c0877f410528c59c00097c4fff861.webp?t=1757992831\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple\u2014feed it, give it toys, and watch its adorable reactions.<br>The cat will nap on the sofa, gaze at you with curious eyes, and make every moment special.\u2728\ud83d\udc3e<br>Every moment on your PC becomes warmer and more fun with this little furball by your side.<br>Experience a small but spec